Prepare/check three frozen OCI archives; registry actions require explicit
approval. No login, pull, build, deployment, tag replacement, or automatic
copy retry exists. Registry V2 tag writes are not atomic create-only: the
caller must reserve these three new task tags exclusively for the whole
absence-check/copy/readback window.

positional arguments:
  {local-check,self-test,publish,reconcile}

